{"id":"n82454-2-5","stage":4,"title":"창백하다 · 明净","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82454-2-5-1","ko":"달이 오늘따라 무척 밝네.","zh":"今天的月亮格外明亮啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"달이","meaning":"月，月亮，月球","explanation":"달：月，月亮，月球；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62266","senseId":"1","lemma":"달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달이","audio":"/audio/8a92097caa828a252964.mp3"}},{"text":"오늘따라","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；따라：强调某个时间、场合等与平常不同，如 오늘따라（偏偏今天）。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘따라","audio":"/audio/63be5b9d45dede0ea5d0.mp3"}},{"text":"무척","meaning":"非常，很","explanation":"무척：非常，很。","readings":[{"term":"무척","audio":"/audio/9d4e17cb57a7915a0528.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55175","senseId":"1","lemma":"무척","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무척","audio":"/audio/9d4e17cb57a7915a0528.mp3"}},{"text":"밝네.","meaning":"亮","explanation":"밝다：亮；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"밝다","audio":"/audio/e97bef4d1c5d4c2fca61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62105","senseId":"1","lemma":"밝다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밝네","audio":"/audio/de9a2809e013a024b517.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2f941e6eb2150679","term":"달","zh":"月，月亮，月球","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3","entryId":"62266","definition":"晚上天空中出现的圆形明亮的发光天体。","pronunciation":["달"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"9d4e17cb57a7915a","term":"무척","zh":"非常，很","audio":"/audio/9d4e17cb57a7915a0528.mp3","entryId":"55175","definition":"程度深得别的无法与之相比。","pronunciation":["무척"]},{"id":"e97bef4d1c5d4c2f","term":"밝다","zh":"亮","audio":"/audio/e97bef4d1c5d4c2fca61.mp3","entryId":"62105","definition":"某物体发出的光很明亮。","pronunciation":["박따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ee615ef854794157303f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82454-2-5-2","ko":"응, 하늘이 맑아서 달빛도 유난히 창백하다.","zh":"嗯，因为天气晴朗，月光显得格外惨白。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"하늘이","meaning":"天空","explanation":"하늘：天空；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"하늘","audio":"/audio/4cd0df8d103d3a7b39d0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20311","senseId":"1","lemma":"하늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하늘이","audio":"/audio/d733272a7eced13bd02f.mp3"}},{"text":"맑아서","meaning":"晴朗，明朗","explanation":"맑다：晴朗，明朗；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"맑다","audio":"/audio/c8398a865a7478831698.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66031","senseId":"2","lemma":"맑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맑아서","audio":"/audio/edae83612dacc2dc7800.mp3"}},{"text":"달빛도","meaning":"月色，月光","explanation":"달빛：月色，月光；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"달빛","audio":"/audio/b162f0baeac46602a8ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44138","senseId":"1","lemma":"달빛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달빛도","audio":"/audio/580ab44eaf4391b0ae03.mp3"}},{"text":"유난히","meaning":"特别，异常，格外","explanation":"유난히：特别，异常，格外。","readings":[{"term":"유난히","audio":"/audio/a981b34035c6d45ef9ae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72421","senseId":"1","lemma":"유난히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유난히","audio":"/audio/a981b34035c6d45ef9ae.mp3"}},{"text":"창백하다.","meaning":"明净，白净","explanation":"창백하다：明净，白净；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"창백하다","audio":"/a